s. Puede deberse a razones legítimas como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No se puede asumir que haya actuado mal sin comprobar los motivos reales.\nQué se puede revisar: Es importante comprobar si los contratos [1], [2] y [3] atienden necesidades similares. También se debe revisar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas distintas. Puede haber razones legítimas por detrás de las decisiones.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 98 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 11.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 8.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 6.0 to 11.9. December accounts for 1% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 4% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 72 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,895 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December and the variety of awardees suggest normal market behavior, not wrongdoing. Small amounts near the limit don't prove improper actions; they could reflect budget constraints or standard pricing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the December contracts for unusual patterns and review awardee A's contracts for repeated purchases. Contract [1] might indicate a trend in late-year spending.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["LDiFtPgZ3M%2FpxJFXpLZ%2B2A%3D%3D","RwYaCxLjV2rkY6rls5tG9A%3D%3D","P8t43rJ4fSQkJPJS%2BPS9vg%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}